WEBVTT

21:35.153 --> 21:38.198
- Your sister, the boy?
- They both have their health,

21:38.323 --> 21:40.325
gods be good.

21:50.586 --> 21:51.920
The raven brought more news.

21:54.047 --> 21:56.425
The king rides for Winterfell...

21:57.467 --> 22:00.262
with the queen and all the rest of them.
